Let's execute.\n\nWait, I also need to sacrifice a creature *as an additional cost*. The Goremand is on the stack? No, it's being cast.\nThe game flow for casting a spell with additional costs usually asks for mana, then targets (n/a), then payment (sacrificing).\nSo first mana.\n\nI'll choose index 1.\n\nOne moment, I should make sure I don't need White for anything else?\nI have `Ninth Bridge Patrol` {1}{W}. If I cast Goremand, I tap out (6 lands, cost 6). So I can't cast anything else.\nSo color doesn't matter for remainder, I just need to satisfy {B}{B}.\n\nDecision: `choice=\"1\"`\n\nThe previous api error `Invalid structured content...` suggests I messed up `attackers=\"all\"`. That's weird, \"all\" is usually valid. But I fixed it by manual selection.\nNow I'm in a choice prompt.\n\nI'll choose index 1.\n\nOne more thing: can I talk?\nThe last chat was Turn 10 Combat. Now Turn 10 Postcombat Main.\n\"It's been 2 turns since you last chatted\" message in the log was just before I sent the message. So I just chatted. I don't need to chat again immediately.\n\nAction: `choose_action(choice=\"1\")`\n\nWait, `choice` parameter takes ID or index or yes/no.\nHere it is an index. String \"1\".\n\nLet's do it.\n\nWait, check the prompt again:\n`Respond: choice=0, choice=1, etc.`\nSo yes, \"1\" is the second option.\n\nOne detail: `Thriving Heath` is tapped in the board state?\n`bf=[..., Thriving Heath, Tithebearer Giant 4/5 (tapped)]`\nWait. `Thriving Heath` is NOT listed as tapped. `Swamp` is not listed as tapped. `Plains` x4 are not listed as tapped.\nOnly creatures are tapped?\n\"Untapped lands: 6\"\nOkay, so I have mana.\n\nOne concern: what if the game asks me to pay costs (sac creature) before mana?\nThe `next_action_type: GAME_CHOOSE_ABILITY` strongly implies mana ability choice.\nIf it were `GAME_SELECT_TARGET` or something for the sacrifice, it would look different.\nAlso the message says \"Choose spell or ability to play: Thriving Heath\". This is definitely the land's ability.\n\nSo yes, `choice=\"1\"`.\n\nThe next step will be paying the cost (sacrificing a creature).\nI plan to sacrifice `Archfiend's Vessel` (1/1) or `Kami` (2/2). `Vessel` is better to sac.\n\nLet's go.\n\n",
