ent sacrifices a creature...\".\nSo the opponent will sacrifice nothing.\n\nLet's execute.\n\nAction: `choose_action(choice=\"p17\")`\n\nAlso I'll chat.\n\nOne note: `Archfiend's Vessel` has an ability \"When {this} enters, if it entered from your graveyard...\". It doesn't trigger on death.\n\nSafe.\nExecuting.\n\n",
