      "decisionIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "At 8 life, casting Tithebearer Giant taps out completely (going to 7 life from the ETB), leaving no mana for Divine Verdict or Valorous Stance to deal with the opponent's threats (including Falkenrath Noble that can attack next turn). The opponent also has 3 unknown cards in hand.",
      "actionTaken": "Cast Tithebearer Giant, tapping out completely at 8 life",
