    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Opponent has no available blockers (Falkenrath Noble is sick, Minotaur Skullcleaver is tapped), so both Crypt Lurker and Oathsworn Vampire could attack freely. Attacking with only Crypt Lurker misses 2 free damage.",
      "actionTaken": "Attacked with only Crypt Lurker (3 damage)",
