      "decisionIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Blocked Crypt Lurker 3/4 with Falkenrath Noble 2/2, trading away a key flying creature for no gain. Noble dies (2 toughness vs 3 power) and Crypt Lurker survives. At 17 life, taking 3 damage is very affordable. The opponent is at 7 life with no flyers - Falkenrath Noble could attack for 2 in the air next turn, and its death-trigger ability provides ongoing value. Trading it away to save 3 life (net 2 with the death trigger) when comfortably ahead on life is throwing away a significant advantage.",
      "actionTaken": "Blocked Crypt Lurker with Falkenrath Noble, trading the Noble for 2 damage on the Lurker and 1 drain from Noble's death trigger.",
      "betterLine": "Don't block. Take 3 damage (go to 14 life). Next turn, attack with Falkenrath Noble in the air for 2 unblockable damage (opponent to 5), keeping the Noble's death trigger ability active for future value.",
      "type": "blunder",
