      "decisionIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Casting Lightning Visionary precombat when it can't attack this turn (summoning sickness). The better precombat play is Mugging on Oathsworn Vampire to kill it, triggering Falkenrath Noble (opponent to 5), then attacking with both Noble (flying) and Skullcleaver unblocked for 4 damage, putting opponent to 1 life. Lightning Visionary adds nothing to the board this turn.",
      "actionTaken": "Cast Lightning Visionary (2/1 with summoning sickness, can't attack this turn)",
      "betterLine": "Cast Mugging targeting Oathsworn Vampire to kill it, trigger Falkenrath Noble drain (opponent to 5), then attack with Falkenrath Noble and Minotaur Skullcleaver for 4 unblocked damage (opponent to 1). Then cast Lightning Visionary postcombat.",
      "type": "blunder",
