      "decisionIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem3P ESPN declined to attack with Tithebearer Giant 4/5 when no opposing creatures could block (Falkenrath Noble tapped, Lightning Visionary summoning sick). This was 4 free damage against an opponent at 20 life. The defensive concern of leaving Tithebearer tapped is mitigated by having Divine Verdict in hand (castable with 4 Plains) to handle any attacker next turn, plus Mire Triton with deathtouch for ground blockers.",
      "actionTaken": "Passed on attacking, dealing 0 damage.",
      "betterLine": "Attack with Tithebearer Giant for 4 unblocked damage, reducing opponent from 20 to 16. Divine Verdict in hand provides adequate defense for the crack-back.",
      "type": "blunder",
