      "player": "Gem3P ESPN",
      "decisionIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "At 3 life facing an opponent at 21 life, declined to cast Skyhunter Patrol (2/3 flying, first strike) despite having exactly the mana for it and no instant-speed plays in hand to save mana for. Skyhunter Patrol is an excellent defensive creature that could block most aerial threats and apply pressure.",
