      "decisionIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Missed lethal by not casting Goremand in precombat main phase. With 4 Plains + 1 Swamp + 1 Thriving Heath (likely producing black), they had the 4BB needed. Sacrifice Archfiend's Vessel to Goremand, then attack with Goremand (5/5 flying trample) + Tithebearer Giant (4) + Skyhunter Patrol (2) + Kami of Ancient Law (2) = 13 damage against opponent's empty board at 11 life. Instead they're attacking for only 9, leaving opponent alive at 2 while sitting at a precarious 3 life.",
